        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johnny Majors, Paul Hornung\n- Roles: Heisman Trophy candidate, professional American football player, running back\n- Organizations: Green Bay Packers, National Football League, Pro Football Hall of Fame\n- Events: 1956 Heisman Trophy voting, NFL championships, first Super Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- In 1956, Johnny Majors finished second to Paul Hornung in voting for the Heisman Trophy.\n- Paul Hornung was born on December 23, 1935.\n- Paul Hornung was nicknamed \"The Golden Boy.\"\n- Paul Hornung was a professional American football player and a Hall of Fame running back.\n- Paul Hornung played for the Green Bay Packers of the National Football League from 1957 to 1966.\n- Paul Hornung won four NFL titles and the first Super Bowl with the Green Bay Packers.",
